    "created_at": "2022-03-11T16:41:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-11T16:41:32Z",
    "body": "I wonder if @tabatkins has opinions here or knows someone who can give input from the perspective of the CSS-related worklets.\r\n\r\nI'm also [not sure](https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?%3C!DOCTYPE%20html%3E%0A...%3Cscript%20type%3Dmodule%3E%0Aw(eval(%22this%22))%0A%3C%2Fscript%3E) how I can get `this` to not return `undefined`:\r\n```html\r\n<script type=module>\r\nconsole.log(eval(\"this\")); // undefined\r\n</script>\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
